        "title": "Cancellation & Refund Policy",
        "body": "Cancellations made before 48 hours of the workshop will incur a 50% cancellation fee. Cancellations made within 48 hours or on the same day of the workshop will not be eligible for any refund. If a workshop is cancelled or rescheduled by VPCC, participants may choose a full refund or transfer their registration to another workshop. Refunds, where applicable, will be processed within 7–10 business days. No adjusting of amount — paid amounts cannot be partially transferred or adjusted against other events, classes, or subscriptions."
